{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":2115,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"a87d7419-f3b6-4289-97a8-09bac3a1bf4e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270809311,"PostDateInt":1746676251000,"PostDate":"2025-05-08T11:50:51","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"嵌入式系统工程师（预研）(J34255)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"20K-40K 元/月","Duty":"1、负责家电产品的底层硬件控制固件开发，基于STM32、ARM Cortex-M系列或Arduino等平台，实现电机控制、传感器采集、通信协议等核心功能。\n2、优化实时响应能力，确保系统满足严格时序要求（如PWM控制、高速ADC采样、中断响应延迟<1μs）。\n3、开发电机驱动算法（如FOC、六步换相），实现高效、低噪声、高精度的运动控制（适用于洗衣机、空调压缩机、扫地机器人等）。\n4、设计低功耗策略（如动态调频、休眠唤醒机制），延长电池供电设备的续航能力（如无线家电产品）。\n5、调试硬件与固件的协同问题（如EMC干扰、信号完整性），配合硬件团队优化PCB布局与滤波设计。\n6、编写稳定可靠的嵌入式代码（C/C++），遵循MISRA-C等编码规范，并具备完善的异常处理机制。\n7、参与整机系统测试，分析性能瓶颈（如控制环路延迟、通信丢包率），提出优化方案并验证。","Require":"1、精通嵌入式C/C++开发，熟悉STM32/HAL库、FreeRTOS或类似实时操作系统（RTOS）。\n2、具备底层硬件驱动开发经验（如GPIO、PWM、ADC、SPI/I2C/UART），能直接操作寄存器优化性能。\n3、熟悉电机控制原理（PID、FOC、SVPWM），有BLDC/PMSM/步进电机实际项目经验。\n4、掌握常用调试工具（如J-Link、逻辑分析仪、示波器），能快速定位硬件/固件问题。\n\n优先条件：\n1、有大家电行业经验（如空调变频控制、洗衣机直驱电机、冰箱压缩机驱动）。\n2、熟悉无线通信协议（BLE、Zigbee）或家电互联标准（如Matter、HomeKit）。\n3、了解MATLAB/Simulink进行控制算法仿真与代码生成（如基于模型设计）。\n\n加分项：\n1、参与过实时性要求严苛的项目（如伺服控制、高速电机驱动）。\n2、熟悉嵌入式Linux驱动开发（如树莓派、Yocto项目）。\n3、有功耗优化经验（通过动态电压调节、时钟门控降低待机功耗）。","ClassificationOne":"DREAME","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-05-08T11:50:51","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f9f1d13e-5655-419f-823b-a97503e0d547","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270809295,"PostDateInt":1746675297000,"PostDate":"2025-05-08T11:34:57","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电子工程师硬件(J34251)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"20K-40K 元/月","Duty":"设计高可靠性电源管理系统（多电压域配电、电池管理、低功耗模式），满足移动机器人动力需求\n\n开发高性能电机驱动模块（BLDC/PMSM/舵机驱动），集成电流环/速度环控制电路\n\n执行信号完整性分析（HyperLynx），解决高速信号（USB3.0/以太网）传输问题\n\n设计抗干扰方案（如电机驱动与敏感传感器的隔离保护）\n\n通过热仿真（Flotherm）优化功率器件散热布局\n\n协同机械团队完成PCB与结构件的匹配设计（如减震安装、电磁屏蔽）\n\n开发电机-编码器-驱动器一体化测试平台\n\n支持量产过程中的硬件问题排查与设计迭代\n\n探索新型驱动技术（SiC/GaN器件应用、无线充电系统）\n\n研究机器人专用硬件方案（如关节模块化电路设计）","Require":"精通4-8层PCB设计（Altium Designer/Cadence），掌握HDI板设计规范\n\n深入理解开关电源设计（Buck/Boost/LLC拓扑），能独立完成>500W电源开发\n\n具备电机驱动全链路开发经验（栅极驱动设计、短路保护、再生能量处理）\n\n熟练使用示波器、逻辑分析仪等调试工具\n\n优先条件：\n\n有机器人关节驱动/移动底盘驱动系统开发经验\n\n熟悉机器人常用通信协议（CAN FD/EtherCAT/RS485）\n\n了解功能安全标准（ISO 13849）与可靠性设计方法\n\n加分项：\n主导过机器人量产项目硬件开发\n\n掌握嵌入式系统设计（ARM/DSP+FPGA架构）\n\n有电机控制算法（FOC）硬件实现经验","ClassificationOne":"DREAME","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-05-08T11:34:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f087f257-9bbf-4966-9f8b-fbf8e8c348a9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270809288,"PostDateInt":1746674860000,"PostDate":"2025-05-08T11:27:40","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机械工程师（预研）(J34244)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"20K-40K 元/月","Duty":"1、负责骨骼结构、关节机构及运动传动系统的设计与优化，包括仿生关节、连杆机构、齿轮/皮带传动系统等。\n2、参与大家电或类似产品的运动机构开发，确保其可靠性、耐久性和静音性。\n3、进行运动学与动力学仿真分析（如ADAMS、ANSYS等），优化关节自由度、负载能力及运动轨迹。\n4、主导传动系统（如电机、减速器、同步带等）的选型与集成，解决扭矩传递、磨损及润滑问题。\n5、协同电子团队完成机电一体化设计，确保传感器（如编码器、力反馈）与机械系统的兼容性。\n6、负责原型机测试与迭代，分析故障模式并提出改进方案（如降低摩擦、减少震动）。\n7、撰写技术文档（BOM、DFMEA、装配工艺等），支持产品量产落地。","Require":"1、熟悉机械设计基础理论（材料力学、机构学、轴承选型等），能独立完成3D建模（SolidWorks/Creo）和工程图纸输出。\n2、具备运动机构开发经验，如仿生关节（旋转/球面/万向节）、多连杆系统或齿轮箱设计。\n3、了解常见传动方式（蜗轮蜗杆、谐波减速器、直线导轨等）及其失效机理。\n4、熟练使用仿真工具（如MATLAB/Simulink进行运动分析）或有限元分析（静力学/疲劳仿真）。\n\n优先条件：\n1、有大家电行业经验（如扫地机滚刷机构、按摩椅机械臂、洗衣机传动系统等）。\n2、熟悉注塑、压铸等工艺，能针对低成本量产优化设计。\n3、了解生物力学基础（如人体关节运动范围、骨骼载荷分布）。\n\n加分项：\n1、参与过仿生机器人、康复器械或高精度运动控制项目。\n2、熟悉ROS或运动控制算法（PID、轨迹规划）。\n3、具备专利申请或论文发表经验（机械设计相关）。","ClassificationOne":"DREAME","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-05-08T11:27:40","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"8d013426-9c3b-42c7-b55c-a8934594e71a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270791867,"PostDateInt":1742366975000,"PostDate":"2025-03-19T14:49:35","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"售后系统工程师(J29200)","OrgId":700061155,"Org":"业务数字化组","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1、系统运维：\n负责系统的日常监控、维护、故障排查和应急处理。\n编写集成方案和部署方案，进行系统发布和部署。\n优化系统性能，确保系统稳定运行。\n2、文档编制：\n协助完成部门的文档编制工作，包括系统部署手册、应急手册、知识库等。\n记录故障详情和解决过程，为后续的运维工作提供参考。\n3、技术支持：\n为公司内部各部门提供IT技术支持，解决相关问题。\n协助研发搭建线上线下测试、生产系统环境，安装部署基础组件、网络服务和中间件应用。\n4、项目管理：\n参与运维相关的项目管理，确保项目按时完成。\n合理规划时间和资源，确保运维工作的顺利进行。","Require":"1、教育背景：\n计算机科学、信息技术或相关领域本科及以上学历。\n2、专业技能：\n熟悉数据库管理（如MySQL、Oracle、SQL Server等），能够进行数据库的安装、配置、备份恢复和性能优化。\n具备良好的网络知识和故障排查能力，熟悉TCP/IP协议和常用网络设备。\n熟悉售后系统（如CRM、工单系统、售后服务平台等）的运维流程和常见问题处理。\n3、工作经验：\n具备2年以上的系统运维工作经验，具备D365、瑞云、销售易等CRM系统售后服务相关经验；\n有大型系统运维、互联网企业运维或家电行业运维经验者更佳。\n4、其他要求：\n具备良好的系统安全意识，能够进行系统安全加固和漏洞扫描。\n强大的问题解决能力，能够快速定位和解决系统故障。\n良好的项目管理能力，能够合理规划时间和资源，确保项目按时完成。\n优秀的沟通和团队协作能力，能够与开发、测试等其他团队有效合作。","ClassificationOne":"苏州","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-03-19T14:49:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"fdb4a024-d2cb-472c-98a2-079799d8c7c8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270781955,"PostDateInt":1740576973000,"PostDate":"2025-02-26T21:36:13","End